CM_ "ChargerLCD_combined V2.1.0 CAN interface, documented from the LCD's point of view. Nodes: LCD = this display/charger-controller; BMS = battery pack / BMS; CHARGER = Beian BA-series power module(s); HOST = config / OTA-flash tool. Bus is 500 kbps-capable CAN 2.0B; the LCD default baud is CONFIG_CAN_BAUD_KBPS (250) and is runtime-selectable (see Baud_Config). All extended (29-bit) frames carry the 0x80000000 flag in their DBC id; standard frames use the raw 11-bit id.";
CM_ BU_ LCD "The Coulomb Li Tech charger display (this firmware). Reads battery telemetry, drives the BA charger module(s), reports status to the BMS, and answers host config/flash commands.";
CM_ BU_ BMS "Battery / BMS. Sends demand or telemetry frames; the LCD auto-detects which protocol is present (CLB / generic-CAN / 11.10 BMS / legacy Coulomb).";
CM_ BU_ CHARGER "Beian BA-series digital power module(s), addresses 1..60. Commanded on 0x1907C080+addr, replies on 0x1807C080+addr. This DBC shows address 1; for module N add N to the base id.";
CM_ BU_ HOST "Configuration / firmware-update tool (e.g. desktop CAN flasher).";
CM_ BO_ 2566848513 "CLB battery charge demand (tp_charger_protocol). RX by LCD. Voltage/current are big-endian; ChargeEnable bit0 = 1 start / 0 stop. A frame with voltage < 1 V is ignored as noise.";
CM_ BO_ 2566848514 "Generic-CAN battery charge demand. Same layout as CLB_Battery_Demand.";
CM_ BO_ 2559980119 "11.10 BMS HeartBeat (pack telemetry). RX by LCD. THIS DBC SHOWS THE ORIGINAL LAYOUT (V=byte0-1, I=byte2-3, SOC=byte6, ChgFET=byte7 bit6). A NEWER pack shifts the fields by one byte (V=byte1-2, I=byte3-4, SOC=byte6) and carries the charge-FET on BMS_Event_Info instead of byte7. The LCD auto-detects: byte0 == 0 means the newer layout. Not a charge request - telemetry only.";
CM_ BO_ 2559590401 "Alternate pack telemetry used by the newer 11.10 pack (parsed in parallel with the HeartBeat). Big-endian. Telemetry only.";
CM_ BO_ 2566850512 "Newer 11.10 pack power-channel states (DLC 4, LSB-0 bit numbering in byte0). The LCD uses ChargeChannel (bit2) as the charge-FET indicator. Telemetry only - does not by itself mark a battery present.";
CM_ BO_ 2566848603 "11.10 BMS -> Charger setpoint / charge command (ZIVAN/ACE, little-endian). ChargerStateSet: 0 disable, 1 enable, 2 full-charge (both 1 and 2 start charging). OutputVoltageSetPt factor is 0.05 V/bit on the NEWER pack and 0.01 V/bit on the ORIGINAL 11.10 pack - the LCD picks the factor from the detected HeartBeat layout. This is the only frame that starts/stops charging for an 11.10 BMS.";
CM_ BO_ 2560688130 "Legacy Coulomb BMS status. RX by LCD. ChargeRelay = charge FET closed; the Op_* bits are the operating-state bitfield (byte4). NOTE: in KION mode a legacy Coulomb BMS makes the LCD stay listen-only - it reads this frame and never commands the charger.";
CM_ BO_ 2560695042 "Legacy Coulomb BMS pack parameters (big-endian). PackCurrent is signed x0.1 A. Only used when no higher-priority battery type is active.";
CM_ BO_ 2566841856 "BMS wall-clock (FromBMS). Used only for SD-log timestamps and on-screen time; charging is never gated on it. Year 0-99 maps to 2000-2099.";
CM_ BO_ 2567422081 "LCD -> BA charger module command (address 1; module N = 0x1907C080+N). Multiplexed by byte0 Command: 0 = Set CC/CV (SetCurrent 24-bit + SetVoltage 32-bit, both big-endian), 1 = status request (no payload), 2 = power (PowerCmd byte7 0x55 ON / 0xAA OFF). SetCurrent is the COMBINED request split across parallel modules by the LCD.";
CM_ BO_ 2550644865 "BA charger module -> LCD reply (address 1; module N = 0x1807C080+N). Multiplexed by byte0 Command echo. For Command==1 (status): OutputCurrent/OutputVoltage (big-endian x0.1) plus the Status0 (byte7) and Status1 (byte6) fault/state bits decoded here.";
CM_ BO_ 2566946945 "LCD -> BA module environment-temperature request (address 1; module N = 0x19008080+N). Empty payload (DLC 0). Polled at ~1 Hz. Suppressed in KION listen-only mode.";
CM_ BO_ 2550169729 "BA module -> LCD temperature reply (address 1; module N = 0x18008080+N). Environment temperature, big-endian signed x0.1 degC (bytes 4-5).";
CM_ BO_ 2579634304 "LCD -> broadcast: enable/disable the modules' automatic current sharing (byte3 0xAA ON / 0x55 OFF, DLC 6). Sent only when more than one charger module is configured.";
CM_ BO_ 2432505114 "LCD -> BMS charger status report (11.10 ChargerToBMS, ACE format, little-endian). Sent at 5 Hz only while an 11.10 BMS is present. OutputCurrent is offset -1600 A (raw = (A+1600)/0.05).";
CM_ BO_ 716 "HOST -> LCD: change CAN baud. byte0 selector 0x01=125k, 0x02=250k, 0x05=500k. Applies immediately, persists to NVS, and is acknowledged by Config_Ack (effect = applied-now). The factory flasher reads the same persisted baud.";
CM_ BO_ 717 "HOST -> LCD: toggle KION listen-only mode. byte0 0x00 = disable, 0x01 = enable. Persisted to NVS and applied on the NEXT boot (not mid-session); acknowledged by Config_Ack (effect = next-boot).";
CM_ BO_ 718 "LCD -> HOST: acknowledgement for Baud_Config / Kion_Config. AckSetting 1=baud 2=kion; AckValue echoes the selector; AckEffect 0=applied now, 1=applies next boot.";
CM_ BO_ 13 "HOST -> LCD: 'enter bootloader' trigger. DLC 8, data = 69 96 69 96 69 96 69 96. Reboots into the factory partition to run the CAN flash. IGNORED while a battery/BMS is actively communicating (disconnect the pack to flash).";
CM_ BO_ 11 "HOST <-> LCD: CAN OTA flash channel (ABMS bootloader v3.6). Activate 0xB1 (echoed), then UNLOCK 0xA0 / DATA 0xA1 / VERIFY 0xA2 / RESET 0xA3 / READ_VERSION 0xA6. Responses are returned on this same id. Byte-stream protocol - only the command byte is modelled here.";
CM_ BO_ 1110 "LCD -> HOST: bootloader idle heartbeat, fixed payload 11 12 13 14 15 16 17 18, every 2 s while in flash mode.";
CM_ BO_ 1794 "LCD -> HOST: factory 'ready to flash' beacon, fixed payload 5A A5 5A A5 5A A5 5A A5.";
CM_ SG_ 2559980119 BatteryCurrent "Signed: positive = charge, negative = discharge.";
CM_ SG_ 2566848603 OutputVoltageSetPt "Factor shown is 0.05 (newer pack). Original 11.10 pack uses 0.01 V/bit.";
CM_ SG_ 2432505114 OutputCurrent "Physical A = raw*0.05 - 1600.";

VAL_ 2566848513 ChargeEnable 0 "Stop" 1 "Enable" ;
VAL_ 2566848514 ChargeEnable 0 "Stop" 1 "Enable" ;
VAL_ 2566848603 ChargerStateSet 0 "Disable" 1 "Enable" 2 "FullCharge" ;
VAL_ 2567422081 Command 0 "SetCCCV" 1 "StatusReq" 2 "Power" ;
VAL_ 2567422081 PowerCmd 85 "PowerOn_0x55" 170 "PowerOff_0xAA" ;
VAL_ 2550644865 Command 0 "SetCCCV_Ack" 1 "Status" 2 "Power_Ack" ;
VAL_ 2579634304 CurrentShareCmd 170 "On_0xAA" 85 "Off_0x55" ;
VAL_ 2432505114 ChargerState 0 "Ideal" 1 "Charging" 2 "Standby" 3 "BatteryFault" 4 "ChargerFault" ;
VAL_ 2432505114 PwrlineState 0 "Disconnected" 1 "Connected" 2 "Error" ;
VAL_ 716 BaudSelector 1 "125kbps" 2 "250kbps" 5 "500kbps" ;
VAL_ 717 KionEnable 0 "Disable" 1 "Enable" ;
VAL_ 718 AckSetting 1 "Baud" 2 "Kion" ;
VAL_ 718 AckEffect 0 "AppliedNow" 1 "NextBoot" ;
